> Try kicking them, like you would kick a door.  Gets 'em every time,
> for me...Every once in a while they 'nimbly evade [my] kick', but this
> is seldom.   Make sure you kick ONLY where they are, or you'll pull a
> muscle...(geez!  I hate this!)

Not neccessarily, you only pull muscles because you have not been
trained how to kick properly. Samurai's and Priests have been taught to
fight using the martial arts and can kick at empty space without doing
themselves an injury. To be effective your character should not be carrying
his maximum load as this makes him/her clumsy and you don't always get
'em as they often 'nimbly evade your clumsy kick'. 

Still I think your luck has a lot to do with it as I have walked into a
bee hive and killed off the bees one by one (except the queen bee) with
just two hits from a +1 katana.

